---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About | Good Mess Learning" active="about">
<header style="position:relative;padding:56px 56px 88px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
<div data-sticker="true" style="position:absolute;right:72px;top:40px;transform:rotate(10deg);background:#FFD23F;color:#1A1220;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:14px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:20px">philosophy-first</div><div data-sticker="true" style="position:absolute;right:220px;top:150px;transform:rotate(-12deg);background:#0BBFB0;color:#1A1220;width:124px;height:124px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;line-height:1.05">curious<br>on purpose</div>
<div style="position:relative;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B8246F">About</div>
<h1 style="position:relative;margin:0;max-width:820px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,92px);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#1A1220;text-wrap:balance">Messy on <em style="color:#E8359A">purpose.</em></h1>
<p style="position:relative;margin:0;max-width:620px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A3F4E;text-wrap:pretty">Learning is supposed to be a good mess, and that's not a flaw to fix. It's the point.</p>
</header><section style="padding:24px 56px 96px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:64px;align-items:start">
<div style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#1A1220">Why <em style="color:#E8359A">"good mess"</em>?</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3F4E">
<p style="margin:0;color:#1A1220;font-size:20px">Real learning is rarely neat. It's curious, hands-on, occasionally chaotic, and full of detours that turn out to matter.</p>
<p style="margin:0">Kids learn best when the work is real: a problem they actually want to solve, a skill they'll use next week, a project that ends with something they made. That kind of learning takes trial, error, and a few spills along the way.</p>
<p style="margin:0">Good Mess Learning is philosophy-first, not curriculum-first. We start with how kids actually learn, then build classes, plans, and coaching around that, for families in every kind of school.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section style="padding:0 56px 112px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:48px">
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.04;color:#1A1220;">What we believe</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:32px 28px;align-items:start">
<div style="transform:rotate(-1.5deg);margin-top:0px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #E8359A" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Authentic learning</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Work that matters outside the lesson. Learners make real things for real audiences.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(1.2deg);margin-top:24px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #FF6B35" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Real-life skills</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Budgeting, measuring, planning, building, and communicating are part of every subject.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(-0.8deg);margin-top:8px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #FFD23F" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Hands-on, project-based</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">If it can be made, tested, or explored instead of just read, that’s how we teach it.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(1deg);margin-top:0px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #0BBFB0" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Personalized to every learner</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Pace, interests, and goals shape the plan. No two learners get the same one.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(-1.2deg);margin-top:24px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #3E2F50" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Access for every learner</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Every learner should have access to what they need to succeed.</p></div>
<div style="transform:rotate(1.4deg);margin-top:8px;background:#fff;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.10);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-top:10px solid #E8359A" data-h="3"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;color:#1A1220">Every kind of school</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#4A3F4E">Homeschool, private, public, or somewhere in between. We work alongside all of it.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#3E2F50;padding:96px 56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden"><div style="position:absolute;right:-160px;top:-160px;width:480px;height:480px;border-radius:50%;background:#652F63"></div><div style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.04;color:#1A1220;color:#FDFAF6;max-width:560px">What a good mess looks like</h2><div style="background:#FFD23F;color:#1A1220;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:14px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;transform:rotate(-3deg)">"Can our lemonade stand turn a profit?"</div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,200px),1fr));gap:20px">
<div style="border-top:4px solid #E8359A;padding-top:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:28px;color:#E8359A">01</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:21px;color:#FDFAF6">Ask a real question</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#E9E2EC">Start with something a learner actually wants to know or fix.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:4px solid #FF6B35;padding-top:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:28px;color:#FF6B35">02</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:21px;color:#FDFAF6">Dig in</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#E9E2EC">Research, read, measure, and interview. Gather what you need.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:4px solid #FFD23F;padding-top:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:28px;color:#FFD23F">03</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:21px;color:#FDFAF6">Make something</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#E9E2EC">Build a prototype, a plan, a budget, or a model.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:4px solid #0BBFB0;padding-top:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:28px;color:#0BBFB0">04</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:21px;color:#FDFAF6">Test, break, fix</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#E9E2EC">Find what doesn’t work and try again. This is the messy part.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:4px solid #FCE8F2;padding-top:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;font-size:28px;color:#FCE8F2">05</span><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:21px;color:#FDFAF6">Share it</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#E9E2EC">Present to a real audience: family, a co-op, a customer.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section style="padding:112px 56px 96px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:56px;align-items:center">
<div style="position:relative;height:460px">
<div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:20px;width:300px;height:370px;background:#fff;padding:14px 14px 56px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.12);transform:rotate(-5deg)"><div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#F1E7EE 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7A6D7E">photo: Tegan</div></div>
<div style="position:absolute;left:210px;top:70px;width:270px;height:330px;background:#fff;padding:14px 14px 56px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(26,18,32,.12);transform:rotate(4deg)"><div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#DDF3F1 0 12px,#FDFAF6 12px 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:11px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#5E7472">photo: family project day</div></div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B8246F">Meet the founder</div>
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.04;color:#1A1220;">Built by someone who's lived every stage.</h2>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3F4E">I'm a FL-certified teacher with 15 years in elementary classrooms, but that's only half the story. For the last 10 years, I've homeschooled my own two kids through middle and high school, both of whom completed dual enrollment and earned Bright Futures scholarships.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#4A3F4E">Alongside that, I've spent the last 8 years coaching homeschool parents and building personalized, hands-on learning experiences, virtually and in person, for families across the country, and in some cases, the world. Good Mess Learning is where all of that comes together.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px">
<span style="background:#FCE8F2;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">FL-certified teacher</span><span style="background:#FFF1E9;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">15 years in the classroom</span><span style="background:#FFF8DC;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">10 years homeschooling</span><span style="background:#E3FBF8;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">8 years coaching families</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="padding:0 56px 96px">
<div style="background:#E8359A;border-radius:40px;padding:72px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
<div style="position:absolute;right:220px;bottom:-90px;width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFD23F"></div>
<h2 style="position:relative;margin:0;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 100;font-weight:900;font-size:56px;line-height:1;color:#FDFAF6;max-width:640px">We'd love to hear what learning looks like at your house.</h2>
<a href="/contact/" style="position:relative;background:#1A1220;color:#FDFAF6;text-decoration:none;padding:18px 32px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;white-space:nowrap" data-h="8">Book a free intro call</a>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
